---
// src/components/Facilities.astro
---

<!-- ==================== FASILITAS KOMPREHENSIF (ARCHITECTURAL AMENITIES CLUSTERING) ==================== -->
<section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-surface-subtle/40 border-b border-border-stone" id="fasilitas">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 xs:px-6 lg:px-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Psychologically Framed: Sensory Comfort & Spiritual Peace) -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="text-[11px] uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-syariah-gold font-semibold">Standar &amp; Kenyamanan</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl xs:text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-on-surface mt-2 tracking-tight">
        Dirancang untuk Istirahat Tenang &amp; Ibadah yang Khusyuk
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs xs:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-3 leading-relaxed text-justify">
        Setiap fasilitas kami siapkan dengan teliti—dari kamar mandi bersih ber-air hangat hingga mushola yang asri—agar Anda dan keluarga beristirahat tanpa rasa was-was.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Clusters in High-End Floating Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Cluster 1: Kenyamanan Kamar Pribadi (Isi 2 Orang) -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">bed</span>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Kenyamanan Kamar Pribadi</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-justify">
            Satu kamar isi 2 orang dengan suasana yang tenang, bersih, dan privat untuk memulihkan energi istirahat Anda sekeluarga.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">ac_unit</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Unit AC Sejuk di Tiap Kamar</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Hembusan dingin dan senyap yang terawat berkala, menjamin tidur malam nyaman tanpa gerah.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">hot_tub</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Kamar Mandi Dalam + Water Heater</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Shower air panas siap menyegarkan tubuh kapan pun Anda tiba di Yogyakarta.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">tv</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Televisi (TV) &amp; WiFi Cepat</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Teman santai melepas lelah di kamar dengan hiburan TV serta koneksi internet fiber stabil.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">dentistry</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Dental Kit &amp; Kebersihan Terjamin</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Disediakan sikat dan pasta gigi higienis baru untuk kenyamanan praktis menginap Anda.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">coffee</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Teh, Kopi, Gula Pasir &amp; Air Mineral</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Fasilitas seduhan hangat kapan pun Anda ingin menikmati secangkir kopi atau teh santai.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-primary font-semibold flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>01 • Kamar Mandi Dalam &amp; AC</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary/60" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cluster 2: Dapur Mini & Ibadah -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-syariah-gold flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">soup_kitchen</span>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Dapur Mini &amp; Ibadah Tenang</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-justify">
            Kemudahan layaknya rumah sendiri dengan dapur mini bersama serta ruang ibadah sholat yang terjaga kebersihannya.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">soup_kitchen</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Dapur Mini Bersama (Kompor &amp; Kulkas)</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Bisa menghangatkan makanan, memasak mie, menyimpan bekal, atau membuat susu untuk anak.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">water_drop</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Dispenser Air Mineral Galon Gratis</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Tersedia air minum higienis panas dan normal sepuasnya tanpa biaya tambahan.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">mosque</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Mushola Khusus &amp; Tempat Wudhu Jernih</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Dilengkapi sajadah, mukena, sarung, dan kran wudhu terpisah berlantai kesat tidak licin.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">deck</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Balkon Terbuka &amp; Koridor Asri</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Area santai berangin sejuk di lantai dua untuk menikmati pagi dan sore hari yang hening.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-syariah-gold font-semibold flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>02 • Dapur Mini &amp; Mushola Bersih</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-syariah-gold/60" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cluster 3: Parkir Mobil & Keamanan -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_35px_-10px_rgba(40,54,43,0.08)] border border-stone-200/80 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">directions_car</span>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Parkir Mobil &amp; Keamanan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-justify">
            Kendaraan keluarga terparkir aman dan tenang di dalam pagar pekarangan penginapan.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">local_parking</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Parkir Mobil &amp; Motor di Dalam Pagar</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Halaman paving block luas dan aman di dalam pagar properti, bukan diparkir di pinggir jalan.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">wifi</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">WiFi Fiber Optik Menjangkau Semua Kamar</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Kecepatan stabil untuk tugas kuliah, rapat online (WFC), streaming, dan video call.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">door_front</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Pagar Tertutup &amp; Lingkungan Tertib</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Gerbang malam terjaga tertib, memberikan rasa aman dan privasi penuh bagi tamu keluarga.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">support_agent</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Komunikasi Ramah Pengelola (Bu Agnesia)</strong>
                <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-justify">Respon cepat dan keramahan khas Yogyakarta untuk membantu segala kebutuhan menginap Anda.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-secondary font-semibold flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>03 • Parkir Mobil Aman di Dalam Pagar</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-secondary/60" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
